---
name: Debugging patterns
description: Trail corruption and frame validation troubleshooting for this project
type: reference
---

## Trail Corruption
- Always check `.pmcro/trails/<trail-id>/` for incomplete `seal.json`
- Re-run Checker before sealing if MakeStep evidence is missing

## Frame Validation Failures
- `PlanFrame` missing `successCriteria` → Planner must re-emit before Maker proceeds
- `CheckFrame` verdict must be `PASS` or `FAIL` — no other values accepted

## Build Issues
- `dotnet build` fails on nullable: add `#nullable enable` to the file header
- `dotnet test` flaky: check for missing `[Fact]` / `[Theory]` attributes
